{{Documentation/Header}}
The standard welcome message left on a new editor's talk page. It points them at the [[Utaite Wiki:Tutorial|tutorial]] and the [[Utaite Wiki:Requirements|requirements]] before they create articles.

Takes no parameters. Sign it yourself — the template does not add a signature.

==Syntax==
<pre>{{Welcome}} ~~~~</pre>

==Usage==
Substitute it rather than transcluding, so the message stays fixed even if this template is later reworded:
<pre>{{subst:Welcome}} ~~~~</pre>